## Editing

- The NoteTab toolbar now has a button for embedding images. Pasting via keyboard shortcut is no longer the only way to insert an image.

- Users can now double-click on images in order to expand them in a view. This view also supports exporting the image to a file.


## Files

- Autosaving is now handled via *delta files*: Instead of autosaving the entire database on a background thread, we now save only changes that were made in the current session. This saves massively on file space, and takes far less work.

- There are now menu options in the File menu for browsing the database and backup folders.

- Backups are now stored in the user's AppData/Local folder, instead of alongside the main database files.


## Language

- For multilingual users, a niche bug has been fixed which would have caused filename conflicts when switching the OS display language.


## Themes

- Finally, I've taken the opportunity to add an **Ice** theme to the predefined list. It's a bright light-mode selection that fills in a niche the existing set didn't have. Users who rely on bright aesthetics for vision or focus will have a much easier time now!
